# Copy this file to `.env` (same folder) and fill in real values.
# `.env` is gitignored — never commit real credentials.

# Spending guard: a real SMS is only ever attempted for a number in this
# comma-separated list (any format — +91, 0-prefixed, bare 10-digit all
# match). Every other vessel always logs SIMULATED and never touches a real
# provider or costs a rupee, regardless of which button fires the alert.
SMS_REAL_NUMBERS=

# Preferred: Fast2SMS (https://www.fast2sms.com) — Indian gateway, free ₹50
# signup credit, no credit card, no DLT business registration needed for its
# "Quick SMS" route. Outbound only (can't receive replies). Get the key from
# your Fast2SMS dashboard's "Dev API" section.
FAST2SMS_API_KEY=

# Fallback: Twilio (https://console.twilio.com) — two-way capable (see
# /api/sms/inbound), but trial accounts cap daily volume and India SMS to a
# foreign number is carrier-outbound-only regardless. Account SID + Auth
# Token are on the Account Dashboard; the number comes from Phone Numbers >
# Manage > Buy a number. Only used if FAST2SMS_API_KEY above is empty.
TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=
TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=
TWILIO_FROM_NUMBER=
